{
  "format": "ziffr.pack/2",
  "id": "ziffr/board-meeting",
  "name": "Board meeting deck",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "summary": "A Deck Template for a quarterly board meeting, a Theme for it, and the Workflow for the quarter's close.",
  "author": {
    "name": "Ziffr"
  },
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "ziffr": ">=0.11",
  "audience": {
    "functions": [
      "management",
      "finance"
    ]
  },
  "listing": {
    "homepage": "https://github.com/ziffr/ziffr/tree/main/packs"
  },
  "guide": {
    "whatItsFor": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "For a quarterly board meeting of any kind of business: key figures, revenue against its target, cash and runway, headcount, highlights and risks."
      }
    ],
    "beforeYouStart": [
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "An **Owner** installs the Pack, because it holds a Theme. An Owner or Admin sets it up.",
          "The person who approves the figures.",
          "Revenue, cash, months of runway and headcount."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "firstSteps": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Start here"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "numbered": true,
        "items": [
          "Open **Settings**, then **Packs**. Under this Pack, choose **Set up from this Pack**.",
          "Keep the four Metrics and the Workflow **Quarter close** ticked, pick the **Approver**, and choose **Set up**.",
          "To have someone else send a figure, open its Metric and add them under **Who submits**. Only a Submitter sees **Record a value** there.",
          "Send the first figures: open a Metric and choose **Record a value**, or answer the request Ziffr sends.",
          "Open **Decks**, choose **From a Deck Template**, pick **Quarterly board meeting** and a Metric for each Slot.",
          "Set a target on **Revenue** so the deck can show revenue against it, and write your highlights and risks on their slide."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "eachPart": [
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "**Revenue** by month, **Cash balance** and **Cash runway** at month end, and **Headcount** by quarter.",
          "The deck **Quarterly board meeting**: six slides, with the **Board** Theme.",
          "The Workflow **Quarter close**: values due on the fifth working day, checked, every value approved by one person, then locked. A figure that is still missing after its Due Date is asked from the Submitter's Stand-in. Choose a Stand-in for each Submitter on the Metric's page."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Is there a dashboard?"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "No. This Pack is made for the deck. Add a dashboard of your own if you want one."
      }
    ]
  },
  "contents": {
    "metrics": [
      {
        "key": "revenue",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Revenue",
          "description": "Net revenue invoiced in the month, excluding VAT, discounts and credit notes.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "cash",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Cash balance",
          "description": "Cash across all bank accounts at period end.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "targetMin": 50000,
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "runway",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Cash runway",
          "description": "Months the cash balance lasts at the average net burn of the last three months.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "months",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 1,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "targetMin": 12,
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "headcount",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Headcount",
          "description": "People on payroll at the end of the quarter.",
          "category": "People",
          "period": "quarter",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "target",
          "unit": "people",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
